## Original Content
🇰🇪 Au Kenya, un jeune créateur de mode mise sur le tissage manuel pour se démarquer. Il fabrique des tissus et des vêtements à la main, faisant revivre un savoir-faire traditionnel menacé par l’industrialisation.

## Summary
In Kenya, a young fashion designer is reviving traditional weaving by handcrafting fabrics and clothes. This effort aims to preserve a traditional skill that is threatened by industrialization.

## Key Points
- A young fashion creator uses manual weaving to stand out in the industry.
- He handcrafts fabrics and clothes to revive traditional weaving techniques.
- Traditional weaving is at risk due to industrialization.
- This initiative supports cultural preservation and sustainable fashion.


